{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/f0502d85f16c8883edbac1ef94cd3260.poster.avif?t=1761239593\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/f0502d85f16c8883edbac1ef94cd3260.webm?t=1761239593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the shadow of an abandoned keep\u00a0lies the all-but-forgotten village of Weepstone. Once a thriving settlement, its fields now stand barren, and its people desperate. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Byron, the Lord of Weepstone, has taken ill, his dreams plagued with visions of unholy rituals and occult symbols.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unlikely commonfolk are tasked to explore the keep to discover the mysterious source of Byron's suffering. There are no heroes here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Secret of Weepstone is a black-and-white, dungeon crawling love letter to old school role-playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/ab654f80fae3ea05d38d6557219225fc.poster.avif?t=1761239593\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/ab654f80fae3ea05d38d6557219225fc.webm?t=1761239593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/ab654f80fae3ea05d38d6557219225fc.mp4?t=1761239593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience gameplay heavily inspired by classic D&amp;D:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice for skill checks and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the dangerous puzzles guarding each dungeon\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a wide variety of creatures through hand-drawn black and white art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters as you find treasure and triumph in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your party with the new weapons and equipment you loot on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace death and gain unique &quot;Mortal Favors&quot; whenever characters die.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of up to 8 members from common villagers to battle-worn adventurers, recruiting new characters along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Demo for The Secret of Weepstone features 7 possible party members and a unique variation of the opening dungeon of the full game.\u00a0</i><br>   </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876150?t=1761239593","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876150?t=1761239593","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/3a71f18373b7b5f45b81a65f25d189ba9b657338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761239593","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/3a71f18373b7b5f45b81a65f25d189ba9b657338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761239593","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game includes fantasy violence, mild black and white gore, and occasional crude or profane language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/f0502d85f16c8883edbac1ef94cd3260.poster.avif?t=1761239593\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/f0502d85f16c8883edbac1ef94cd3260.webm?t=1761239593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the shadow of an abandoned keep\u00a0lies the all-but-forgotten village of Weepstone. Once a thriving settlement, its fields now stand barren, and its people desperate. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Byron, the Lord of Weepstone, has taken ill, his dreams plagued with visions of unholy rituals and occult symbols.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unlikely commonfolk are tasked to explore the keep to discover the mysterious source of Byron's suffering. There are no heroes here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Secret of Weepstone is a black-and-white, dungeon crawling love letter to old school role-playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/ab654f80fae3ea05d38d6557219225fc.poster.avif?t=1761239593\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/ab654f80fae3ea05d38d6557219225fc.webm?t=1761239593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/extras/ab654f80fae3ea05d38d6557219225fc.mp4?t=1761239593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience gameplay heavily inspired by classic D&amp;D:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice for skill checks and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the dangerous puzzles guarding each dungeon\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a wide variety of creatures through hand-drawn black and white art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters as you find treasure and triumph in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your party with the new weapons and equipment you loot on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace death and gain unique &quot;Mortal Favors&quot; whenever characters die.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of up to 8 members from common villagers to battle-worn adventurers, recruiting new characters along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Demo for The Secret of Weepstone features 7 possible party members and a unique variation of the opening dungeon of the full game.\u00a0</i><br>   </p>","developers":["Talesworth Game Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3702100","name":"The Secret of Weepstone"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876150/3e8cc9d1732fbb9fdd56515778cda01c24b7d8cf/header.jpg?t=1761239593","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3876150/2004183129/d55884d0c40129c2095d8961dacf015eaf89dc2d/1761228766/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761239425","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3876150/2004183129/d55884d0c40129c2095d8961dacf015eaf89dc2d/1761228766/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761239425","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3876150/2004183129/d55884d0c40129c2095d8961dacf015eaf89dc2d/1761228766/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761239425","id":257221665,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221665/movie480.mp4?t=1761239425","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com